# Cease: "Exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard." Choosing no first card and a Lightning Bolt of Bot2's graveyard
# as the second is the same as choosing that one card: "up to two" lets Bot1 choose any one card from any graveyard, however the
# slots are filled. Bot1's own Bolt and Bot2's other Bolt stay. The player is Bot2, the opponent: "target player gains 2 life and
# draws a card" is not limited to the caster (17 to 19, one card drawn).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mountain
Swamp
Lightning Bolt
Cease // Desist
Forest
Forest
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x16

